    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "As with Equation 16.11, a test statistic T is obtained as the sum of the $ t^{2} $ values over all N informative contrasts, with T significantly greater than N being taken as evidence for a linked QTL.",
      "source_page": 518,
      "printed_page": 498,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter16:p014:b16"
      ],
      "bbox": [
